---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/FlowIcon.astro';
import ScrollConnections from '../components/ScrollConnections.astro';
import FieldNotesPreview from '../components/FieldNotesPreview.astro';
import { consultingUrl } from '../lib/site-links';
import '../styles/visual-home.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Hyphos — your best people have better things to do" description="Less chasing information. Less entering it twice. Hyphos connects the knowledge behind your work, with people providing judgment where it matters.">
<div class="visual-page v-dark">
  <section class="v-hero v-shell">
    <p class="v-eyebrow">Hyphos · Developing with design partners</p>
    <h1>Your best people<br /><em>have better things to do.</em></h1>
    <p class="v-intro">Less chasing information. Less entering it twice. Less explaining it again.</p>
    <p class="v-hero-context">Hyphos connects the knowledge behind your work and helps carry it forward—with people providing judgment where it matters.</p>
    <div class="v-actions"><a href="#how-it-works" class="button button--gold">See how it works ↓</a><a href="#field-notes" class="text-link">Explore the field notes ↓</a></div>
    <details class="v-detail"><summary>What is Hyphos?</summary><div><p>Hyphos connects the context scattered across AI conversations, documents, meetings, client relationships, scopes of work and regulations. The relationships stay visible: what was promised, what applies, what changed and why.</p><p>We’re developing the product with design partners around real workflows. <a href="/pricing">See what a pilot involves ↗</a></p></div></details>
  </section>
  <ScrollConnections />
  <section id="client-example" class="v-chapter v-light-chapter"><div class="v-shell">
    <div class="v-chapter-heading"><p class="v-eyebrow">02 · From business development to delivery</p><h2>A promise made.<br /><em>A scope that remembers.</em></h2></div>
    <figure>
      <div class="v-promise-scene">
        <div class="v-promise-note"><Icon name="conversation" /><p>Client conversation</p><blockquote>“We’ll include a site assessment.”</blockquote><small>Easy to lose between the call and the proposal.</small></div>
        <span class="v-arrow" aria-label="linked to the scope">→</span>
        <div class="v-decision"><div class="v-decision-header"><Icon name="scope" /><strong>The scope.<br />With its context.</strong></div><dl><div><dt>Included</dt><dd>Site assessment</dd></div><div><dt>Source</dt><dd>Client call & proposal</dd></div><div><dt>Review</dt><dd>Applicable requirements</dd></div></dl></div>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="v-caption" style="text-align:center">Illustrative example · A client commitment linked to the work it affects</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <details class="v-detail"><summary>What gets lost between the call and delivery?</summary><div><p>A sales conversation sets an expectation. An AI chat helps shape the proposal. A scope defines the work, while regulations and internal standards introduce requirements. Those pieces need to stay connected as the work changes.</p><p>Hyphos is designed to connect those sources so people can trace the commitment, review what applies and resolve gaps before they carry into delivery.</p></div></details>
  </div></section>
  <section class="v-chapter"><div class="v-shell">
    <div class="v-chapter-heading"><p class="v-eyebrow">03 · Carry it forward</p><h2>New person.<br /><em>Same understanding.</em></h2></div>
    <figure>
      <div class="v-handoff"><div class="v-person"><Icon name="people" /><span>Today’s team</span></div><div class="v-task"><p>Next step · Operations lead</p><h3>Prepare the site assessment.</h3><ul><li><Icon name="check" />Commitment: site assessment</li><li><Icon name="check" />Scope & requirements linked</li><li><Icon name="document" />Client conversation included</li></ul></div><div class="v-person"><Icon name="people" /><span>The next person</span></div></div>
      <figcaption class="v-caption" style="text-align:center">Illustrative handoff · Sample content</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <details class="v-detail"><summary>What changes at the handoff?</summary><div><p>The next person gets more than an instruction. They can see the client commitment, the scope, the relevant sources and the work still to do, without asking someone to reconstruct every conversation.</p><p>Hyphos supports their judgment; the team remains responsible for reviewing and carrying out the work.</p></div></details>
    <div class="v-work-links"><a href="/architecture" class="text-link">Explore how Hyphos is designed ↗</a></div>
  </div></section>
  <section id="domas" class="v-chapter v-domas"><div class="v-shell">
    <div class="v-chapter-heading"><p class="v-eyebrow">Domas · Build & evolve</p><h2>Hyphos, shaped<br /><em>around your business.</em></h2><p>Domas builds and evolves Hyphos around your workflows, terminology and requirements.</p></div>
    <figure>
      <div class="v-domas-flow"><div class="v-business-needs"><div><Icon name="people" /><span>Your process</span></div><div><Icon name="document" /><span>Your terminology</span></div><div><Icon name="regulations" /><span>Your requirements</span></div></div><div class="v-domas-core"><strong>Domas</strong><span aria-label="shapes">→</span></div><div class="v-tailored"><p>Hyphos for your business</p><h3>Your way of working.</h3><ol><li><span>01</span>Client intake</li><li><span>02</span>Scope approval</li><li><span>03</span>Delivery & review</li></ol></div></div>
      <figcaption class="v-caption" style="text-align:center">Illustrative workflow · Shaped with your team</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p class="v-domas-loop">Understand the business → Build → Review → Evolve ↻</p>
    <details class="v-detail"><summary>How Domas adapts Hyphos to you</summary><div><p>Your business has its own language, relationships, approval steps and exceptions. Domas is the build and adaptation capability behind Hyphos: it carries that context into planning, building and reviewing changes to the platform.</p><p>The result can include tailored workflows, integrations and capabilities. Changes are shaped with your team and reviewed before release, with the reasoning retained for the next improvement.</p><p><a href="/architecture#domas">Explore Domas and the architecture ↗</a></p></div></details>
  </div></section>
  <FieldNotesPreview />
  <section class="v-closing v-shell"><p class="v-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:20px">Start small</p><h2>Does this happen<br /><em>in your business?</em></h2><p>A question is enough. There’s no need for a prepared brief.</p><div class="v-actions"><a href="mailto:info@hyphos.io?subject=A%20question%20about%20Hyphos" class="button button--gold">Ask us a question ↗</a><a href="/contact" class="text-link">Talk with us ↗</a></div><p>Opens your email app.</p></section>
  <div class="v-bridge v-shell"><span>A product from Hyphos Inc.</span><a href={consultingUrl}>Need help connecting your business systems? ↗</a></div>
</div>
</BaseLayout>
